  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5705.06 Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5705.06 Fees.\n\n(a) There shall be no fee for providing criminal history records in response to an electronic request for a record that does not involve a request to process fingerprints.\n\n(b) There shall be a fee collected by the division as the fee is established and set by the FBI, for handling a request involving fingerprint processing for noncriminal justice purposes.\n\nSource. #8173, eff 9-21-04; amd by #9329, eff 11-21-08; ss by #10208, eff 10-22-12; ss by #12132, eff 3-17-17; renumbered by #12606 (formerly Saf-C 5705.06)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5700.html"
